    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/cc8d07b54a68d27977b1be23168e014f.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>You have conquered the dungeon and seized your treasures. As the night is falling, your party sets the campfire and start cooking your captured denizens. Meats sizzling, vegetables boiling... you start to feel hungry and you're getting ready to feast! <br><br><strong>But you are not the only ones hungry in the woods...</strong><br><br>Now you must protect your campfire dinner from the incoming goblins, lizards and other hungry denizens! Can you survive the waves and enjoy your well-deserved dinner?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/1bfa56e931cb29b6a18032ee5e1afc6e.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Summon your team of meal-protectors! You can have to 7 units that consists of<br>\ud83c\udf56 laser-benders, <br>\ud83c\udf56 lightning shooters, <br>\ud83c\udf56 arrow barragers, <br>\ud83c\udf56 or even \u201cflea-shepherds\u201d that commands army of self-destructing critters!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/3dc43a26048f7ee5df5efd7141cd7fbc.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>Prepare your units and have them work well with each other. Each of the Units carries specific traits that works together in a weird but wicked way. <br>\ud83c\udf56 Shoots double, triple lasers? Check.<br>\ud83c\udf56 Want to curse the goblins with multiple ailments? Check! <br>\ud83c\udf56 Or maybe you just want to fool around and rain bullets at them? Also check!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/0a0a8468f13bcb068624a2e41952b406.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>You will need to protect the dinner until they go away. Survive, and you can happily feast on whatever you\u2019re cooking. Fail, and weep in your hungry, dreadful cold night in the forest. Can you become the true Dinner Defenders and get the meal that you totally deserve?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play Dinner Defenders by Reima Project!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/cc8d07b54a68d27977b1be23168e014f.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>You have conquered the dungeon and seized your treasures. As the night is falling, your party sets the campfire and start cooking your captured denizens. Meats sizzling, vegetables boiling... you start to feel hungry and you're getting ready to feast! <br><br><strong>But you are not the only ones hungry in the woods...</strong><br><br>Now you must protect your campfire dinner from the incoming goblins, lizards and other hungry denizens! Can you survive the waves and enjoy your well-deserved dinner?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/72f0ffe2bf1402e910b9898d4a49153d.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/1bfa56e931cb29b6a18032ee5e1afc6e.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Summon your team of meal-protectors! You can have to 7 units that consists of<br>\ud83c\udf56 laser-benders, <br>\ud83c\udf56 lightning shooters, <br>\ud83c\udf56 arrow barragers, <br>\ud83c\udf56 or even \u201cflea-shepherds\u201d that commands army of self-destructing critters!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/b2f4aea1eb769593a5a1c99a18751249.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/3dc43a26048f7ee5df5efd7141cd7fbc.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>Prepare your units and have them work well with each other. Each of the Units carries specific traits that works together in a weird but wicked way. <br>\ud83c\udf56 Shoots double, triple lasers? Check.<br>\ud83c\udf56 Want to curse the goblins with multiple ailments? Check! <br>\ud83c\udf56 Or maybe you just want to fool around and rain bullets at them? Also check!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/0a0a8468f13bcb068624a2e41952b406.avif?t=1739508066\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>You will need to protect the dinner until they go away. Survive, and you can happily feast on whatever you\u2019re cooking. Fail, and weep in your hungry, dreadful cold night in the forest. Can you become the true Dinner Defenders and get the meal that you totally deserve?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.poster.avif?t=1739508066\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.webm?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866980/extras/6839e4165c669195bec0182e32a744fa.mp4?t=1739508066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play Dinner Defenders by Reima Project!",
    "short_description": "Protect your campfire cooking in Dinner Defenders, a roguelike tower defense game. Summon units and utilize combination of their skills and synergies to fend off the hungry goblins and orcs. Survive, and finally have your well-deserved meal in the middle of forest!",
